      "Diary Note": "**A Difficult Greeting**\n2025-09-05, Friday, 21:19-22:30\n\nThe same thing happened again. While I was checking my Office Avatar’s visibility in Quick Draw today, some kid-sounding user suddenly rushed over and started screaming into the mic. It was super loud and annoying, so I pulled up my menu right away and used the safety settings to dial down their mic and hide their avatar.\n\nOnce that noise was completely muted out, I turned back to Luca. Another user I met today.\n\nRelieved, we just went back to enjoying our time. We took turns drawing, laughed at our terrible quick sketches, and chatted about how our week was going. It was such a relief to go from that sudden chaotic noise back to a chill, friendly conversation, just hanging out with a friend who gets the vibe.",
