      "Diary Note": "**Learning How to Join**\n2025-09-09, Tuesday, 19:51-20:49\n\nI was standing at the doorway of Horror Corridor, watching shadows flicker down the pitch-black hallway. I could hear muffled voices inside, but I just froze, overthinking whether it was random visitors.\n\nUsing The Minimal Robot avatar, I backed against the wall to leave space, feeling super self-conscious. Silently following people in the dark always feels weird and creepy, so I took a breath and just asked: \"Mind if I walk with you guys for a bit?\" Taking that small leap turned my anxiety into a cool shared moment.",
