      "Diary Note": "**Avatar Became the First Social Cue**\n2025-09-10, Wednesday, 21:01-22:08\n\nI stood at the edge of the crowd, the chatter fading as I focused on my new avatar. I caught my reflection and noticed the coat looked good from the front. But every time the idle animation turned sideways, my face completely disappeared! Did others notice this when we talked? I wondered if I looked a bit strange. \n\nI always check whether I am less visible after avatar switching. It is funny how much I worry about this digital coat, but I guess here, my avatar really is the first impression to others.",
