      "Diary Note": "**Funny Moment**\n2025-10-08, Wednesday, 20:06-21:16\n\nA users named Rin talk about her career problems under the big cherry tree. I really try to listen, but a strange audio bug happen. My Idol avatar start making a loud bell sound every time I move my head. I think the physics for the dress bells break. Rin stop talking and look at me. My left arm also twist backward into a crazy angle. I try to fix it, but the bell sound just get faster. I open my settings and turn off my avatar audio completely. We sit there in quiet for a minute. Rin look at my twisted arm and ask if I need to go to a real doctor hahaha. I just shake my head and type in the chat box that I am fine. She continue talking about how her boss never listen to her ideas.",
      "Diary Note (Chinese)": null,
